        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 153 adds support for the <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-5/#scroll-axis-lock\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">scroll-axis-lock</code></a> CSS property; see <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5908461532610560\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5908461532610560</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds a ref page for the new property.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45606",
            "title": "Technical review: Document scroll-axis-lock property",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-10T16:43:06.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-10T16:41:27.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176228199?u=79263a5800d6a0c47f8ce53365fc113d033acaad&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The last of four PRs splitting up <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5382179114\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45563\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45563/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45563\">#45563</a>. Draft, like <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5409965975\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45603\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45603/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45603\">#45603</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These are the 28 HTML, WebAssembly and media pages where <strong>more than one paragraph</strong> sits after the <code class=\"notranslate\">{{InteractiveExample}}</code> macro and therefore renders inside the \"Try it\" section. As currently written, each block moves up above the macro.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The same open question as <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5409965975\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45603\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45603/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45603\">#45603</a> applies here — whether these belong above the demo or in a <code class=\"notranslate\">## Description</code> section after it. Whatever is decided there, I will apply the same treatment to this PR, so it is probably easiest to settle it on <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5409965975\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45603\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45603/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45603\">#45603</a> alone.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The largest cases are in this PR: <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;picture&gt;</code> and the <code class=\"notranslate\">tabindex</code> global attribute both have eight paragraphs after the macro, which is well past the \"very short summary\" the template intends before the demo.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Same underlying issue as <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5409960912\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45601\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45601/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45601\">#45601</a>: prose placed after the <code class=\"notranslate\">{{InteractiveExample}}</code> macro renders inside the \"Try it\" section, after the demo's code, instead of reading as part of the page's description.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45604",
            "title": "Move multi-paragraph descriptions out of the Try it section on HTML and WebAssembly pages",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-11T21:31:03.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-10T08:45:16.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "husamemadH",
                "url": "https://github.com/husamemadH"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176228199?u=79263a5800d6a0c47f8ce53365fc113d033acaad&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The third of four PRs splitting up <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5382179114\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45563\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45563/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45563\">#45563</a>. Draft until <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5409960912\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45601\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45601/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45601\">#45601</a> and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5409963262\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45602\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45602/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45602\">#45602</a> are resolved, since this one raises a question those two don't.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These are the 70 CSS pages where <strong>more than one paragraph</strong> sits after the <code class=\"notranslate\">{{InteractiveExample}}</code> macro and therefore renders inside the \"Try it\" section. As currently written, this PR moves each block up above the macro, the same way as the single-sentence PRs.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>The open question:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45563#issuecomment-3389310786\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45563/hovercard\">in review on the previous PR</a> <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/wbamberg/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/wbamberg\">@wbamberg</a> noted that the interactive example should come after a very short, preferably one-sentence summary, and that longer descriptions belong after the demo in a <code class=\"notranslate\">## Description</code> section. <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Josh-Cena/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Josh-Cena\">@Josh-Cena</a> agreed that discretion is needed, and that an intro which gets too long should be broken off into <code class=\"notranslate\">## Description</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">That applies to this PR rather than to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5409960912\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45601\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45601/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45601\">#45601</a>/<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5409963262\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45602\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45602/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45602\">#45602</a>. So before this is reviewed in detail, it would help to know which you'd prefer:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Move the paragraphs above the macro, as currently written.</li>\n<li>Add a <code class=\"notranslate\">## Description</code> section after the demo and put them there.</li>\n<li>Decide per page, based on how long the intro becomes.</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Only 4 of these 70 pages currently have a <code class=\"notranslate\">## Description</code> section, so option 2 means adding the heading in most cases.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For what it's worth, <code class=\"notranslate\">list-style-type</code> was fixed upstream while this was in progress by adding a <code class=\"notranslate\">## Description</code> section — so that appears to be the preferred shape. I have left that page and <code class=\"notranslate\">list-style</code> out of this PR since they are already done.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Same underlying issue as <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5409960912\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45601\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45601/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45601\">#45601</a>: prose placed after the <code class=\"notranslate\">{{InteractiveExample}}</code> macro renders inside the \"Try it\" section, after the demo's code, instead of reading as part of the page's description.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45603",
            "title": "Move multi-paragraph descriptions out of the Try it section on CSS pages",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-10T15:53:01.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-10T08:45:03.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "husamemadH",
                "url": "https://github.com/husamemadH"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #38262.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2868431764\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38262\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/38262/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38262\">#38262</a></p>",
