        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds a note for <code class=\"notranslate\">::-webkit-scrollbar</code>:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox 155: support being limited to a pref-controlled site list</li>\n<li>Firefox 156: being reported as unsupported in <code class=\"notranslate\">@supports</code> conditions</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox 153 started reporting <code class=\"notranslate\">::-webkit-scrollbar</code> as supported, and these two changes walk that back.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Bugzilla: <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2061547\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2061547</a></li>\n<li>Bugzilla: <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2062782\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2062782</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Project <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5234311678\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45303\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45303/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45303\">#45303</a></li>\n<li>Project <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5312309127\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45432\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45432/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45432\">#45432</a></li>\n<li>BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5182473497\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30265\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30265/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30265\">mdn/browser-compat-data#30265</a></li>\n</ul>",
